  "hookSpecificOutput": {
    "hookEventName": "PreToolUse",
    "additionalContext": "Memories this project recorded about this file:\n- [convention] Validating renovate.json beyond the pre-commit validator: run Renovate 44 in local mode on a scratch copy, 'mise x node@24 -- npx --package renovate@latest -- renovate --platform=local --dry-run=lookup' with LOG_LEVEL=debug LOG_FORMAT=json and GITHUB_COM_TOKEN set from GH_TOKEN (Rod approved using it); Node 26 is unsupported. Read the 'packageFiles with updates' log message. Use a scratch copy pinned to an older version to see updates. Ruff derives its target version from requires-python, so bumping Python rewrites code (PEP 758 unparenthesised except, PEP 649 unquoted annotations); check scripts that run on older Python before accepting."
  }
}

